    comment "en" """
        Source V5793 = ICD-10-SE V57.9 (Occupant of pick-up truck or van injured in collision with fixed
        or stationary object, unspecified occupant, traffic accident) with Swedish 5th-char activity
        code SNOMED CT 214031005 217897003 36198007 = annan sysselsättning (other activity). Targets are
        the standard OMOP crosswalk for base V57.9 (Athena ICD10/SNOMED CT Maps to: 436292 217897003;
        437165 214031005; 444074 36198007). The activity-code dimension (Swedish national extension) and
        the vehicle-type/occupant-role granularity have no SNOMED CT representation and are lost. Targets
        legitimately subsume the source (every V5793 case is a stationary-object collision in a
        motor-vehicle traffic accident). : verified crosswalk for the base code with a small,
        well-understood breadth mismatch from the activity suffix.
        """
}
